\begin_layout Description
\begin_inset Formula ${\displaystyle \lim_{h\to0}(1+h)^{1/h}=e}$
\end_inset

: 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "proofOfLimit"

\end_inset

Mulailah dengan memperhatikan bahwa 
\begin_inset Formula $\ln\left[(1+h)^{1/h}\right]=\frac{\ln(1+h)}{h}$
\end_inset

.
 Tetapkan 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
L & = & \lim_{h\to0}\frac{\ln(1+h)}{h}\\
 & = & \lim_{h\to0}\frac{\frac{d}{dh}(\ln(1+h))}{\frac{d}{dh}(h)}\\
 & = & \lim_{h\to0}\frac{1}{1+h}\\
 & = & 1.
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Dengan demikian, 
\begin_inset Formula $L=1$
\end_inset

, dan karena fungsi eksponensial 
\begin_inset Formula $e^{x}$
\end_inset

 kontinu, 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
e=e^{L}=e^{\lim_{h\to0}\frac{\ln(1+h)}{h}}=\lim_{h\to0}e^{\frac{\ln(1+h)}{h}} & = & \lim_{h\to0}e^{\ln\left[(1+h)^{1/h}\right]}\\
 & = & \lim_{h\to0}(1+h)^{1/h}.
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Description
\begin_inset Formula $\tilde{e}_{4}(h)$
\end_inset

: 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "eTilde4"

\end_inset

Kita menggunakan rumus 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:richardsonBasis"

\end_inset

 dengan 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha=\frac{1}{2}$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $m=4$
\end_inset

, dan 
\begin_inset Formula $n=5$
\end_inset

 untuk memperoleh
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\tilde{e}_{4}(h) & = & \frac{16\tilde{e}_{3}\left(\frac{h}{2}\right)-\tilde{e}_{3}(h)}{15}\\
 & = & e+O(h^{5}).
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Dengan menerapkan rumus ini pada 
\begin_inset Formula $\tilde{e}_{3}(0.01)$
\end_inset

 dan 
\begin_inset Formula $\tilde{e}_{3}(0.005)$
\end_inset

, kita memperoleh
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\tilde{e}_{4}(0.01) & = & \frac{16(2.718281828448482)-2.718281828281785}{15}\\
 & = & 2.718281828459595,
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

nilai yang akurat hingga 13 angka signifikan!
\end_layout

